  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2\n- Resolve qualified and aliased mixin references and copy all parts of partial implementations.\n- Diagnose cycles and invalid mixin inputs, and copy shared dependencies once.\n- Support nested, generic, and record targets. Preserve imports, active code, and nullable and unsafe contexts when copying members.\n- Ship the generator as a compiler analyzer.\n\nv1.0.1\n- Add XML comments to some generated types and members to avoid warnings when XML documentation generation is enabled.\n\nv1.0.0\n- Initial release.",
